  "name": "term",
  "description": "A low-level Rust library for terminal abstraction, providing robust support for terminfo database parsing and cross-platform terminal formatting. It implements a unified trait-based interface that abstracts over Unix-style ANSI escape sequences via terminfo and native Win32 Console API calls for Windows compatibility. The engine includes a complete terminfo parameter expansion system and database discovery logic following ncurses conventions.",
